### ⚠️ **npm test Failure**
`npm test` fails with exit 2 due to a **pre-existing bug** in `sw-code-review-test.sh` (line 40):
```bash
sed -i '' "s|\$TEST_TEMP_DIR|$TEST_TEMP_DIR|g"  # ← macOS syntax, fails on Linux
```
This is unrelated to project-detect. The agent correctly recognized this and did not falsely declare the loop complete.

