**AUDIT_PASS**

The project type auto-detection feature is fully implemented, properly tested (43/43 passing), well-integrated, and working correctly. The individual feature tests demonstrate no regressions. The npm test suite failure is a pre-existing infrastructure issue in an unrelated test file, not a result of this work.
